  (descr "CC-Antenna-DK (SWRR070, rev 1.0.2) board #10: 20 x 95 mm, 2-layer FR-4. A 2 mm wide L-shaped strip of about 51 mm on both layers (a shorter, loaded quarter wave for 868 MHz). Port at the uSMA feed line; the series matching positions are bridged (0 ohm) and the shunt positions are left open. The 0.25 mm stitching vias are left out (they would make the mesh huge).")
